exports[`permission requests permissionNotice 1`] = `
"This session, "Fix the bug", which you started with courier_spawn, is waiting for permission and does nothing until it is answered.
It asks for: shell
On:
- git push

Do not decide this yourself. Ask the person you are working with (with your question tool, if you have one), offering exactly these choices:
- once: allow this request only
- reject: refuse it, with a reason if they give one; the session's call fails and it carries on
When they have chosen, call courier_answer with sessionID "ses_child", requestID "per_1", reply set to their choice and, with reject, message set to their reason."
`;

