What they choose there is passed on to the session as a message, which wakes it. If you cannot use your question tool, or they answer some other way, call courier_answer with sessionID "ses_child", requestID "question_1" and answers: one entry per question, in order, each the label they chose or the text they gave (a list of labels where a question allows several)."
